[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0242","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3789","title":"Apple QuickTime AVI文件解析内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理畸形 AVI 文件时存在内存破坏漏洞，由于对 AVI 文件格式的解析逻辑存在缺陷，远程攻击者可诱导用户打开特制的 AVI 文件，触发内存损坏导致应用程序崩溃，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.x 至 10.6.5 版本及 QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如访问恶意网站或打开恶意文件）。Apple 已在 Mac OS X 10.6.5 安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3789"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"立即将 QuickTime 升级至 7.6.9 或更高版本（Windows 系统），Mac OS X 10.6.x 用户升级至 10.6.5。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 AVI 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2010/CVE-2010-3789.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3789.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3789","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2010.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3789.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2010/CVE-2010-3789.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3q8r-jx8c-38w3/GHSA-3q8r-jx8c-38w3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_macosx_su10-007.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c699f8d-cd2c-4074-b070-5790432092a8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0241","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3788","title":"Apple QuickTime 7.x JP2图片处理未初始化访问漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.x版本存在输入验证漏洞，处理JP2、FlashPix和GIF图像等文件时可能访问未初始化的内存区域，导致内存损坏。该漏洞影响Windows和macOS系统，攻击者可通过精心 crafted 的图片文件触发漏洞，实现远程代码执行或导致应用程序崩溃。攻击者无需身份验证即可利用此漏洞，严重威胁软件安全性。该漏洞最初披露于2010年，对广大使用QuickTime的用户构成安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3788"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.6.9 或更高版本，同时将 Mac OS X 升级至 10.6.5 或更高版本（对应安全更新 2010-007）。在完成升级前，避免在浏览器中打开来源不明的 JP2 图片文件，并禁用 QuickTime 浏览器插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2010/3xxx/CVE-2010-3788.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3788","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-3788.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-3788.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-m98f-7rvg-34wv/GHSA-m98f-7rvg-34wv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_macosx_su10-007.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/quicktime_769.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_113900_114000.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/macosx_Quicktime769.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-3788.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0240","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3787","title":"Apple QuickTime JP2图像处理堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理 JP2 图像时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的 JP2 图片文件，当用户使用受影响版本的 QuickTime 打开该恶意文件时，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.6.x 及更早版本，攻击者需诱使用户访问恶意 JP2 图像方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3787"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-16T22:00:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:32Z","remediation":"将 Mac OS X 升级至 10.6.5 或更高版本，该更新包含 QuickTime 7.6.9，修复了 JP2 图像处理中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议在邮件网关和 Web 代理层面拦截可疑的 JP2 文件，并教育用户不要打开来源不明的图片文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Nov/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4435","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/309873","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44798","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024729","https://