"kev"],"published":"2010-11-10T03:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:36Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2010 年 11 月安全公告 MS10-087 对应更新（Office 2003 对应 KB2423930，Office 2007 对应 KB2423931，Office 2010 对应 KB2423932），可通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update 自动获取。临时缓解措施：启用 Microsoft Office 文件阻止策略，阻止 RTF 文件通过 Outlook 或 Office 打开；或使用 Microsoft 提供的 Fix it 自动解决方案禁用 RTF 解析功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=880","http://secunia.com/advisories/38521","http://secunia.com/advisories/42144","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8293","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44652","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024705","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-313A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2923","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-087","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11931","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-3333","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24526","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-3333.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2010/CVE-2010-3333.json","https://github.com/firmianay/CTF-All-In-One/blob/a105064770f3454d168c2c5cf5c0763fb7d5f6e3/doc/7_exploit.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-3333","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/Rover/Rover_hash.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2010/README.md","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/rtfobj.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/carterMgj/carterMgj.github.io/blob/db88e562a18998b0e49e309933c217c8959869a2/_posts/2016-04-27-CVE-2010-3333.md","https://github.com/hanul93/kicomav/blob/bad9493528cf88fca8d52db1c09d6f6dd8b272e9/kicomav/plugins/rtf.py","https://github.com/Sunqiz/CVE-2010-3333-reproduction","https://github.com/whiteHat001/cve-2010-3333","https://github.com/gousseine-systems/vuln-rabilit-windows7"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0257","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4156","title":"PHP Libmbfl mb_strcut 函数信息泄露漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.x 版本中使用的 Libmbfl 1.1.0 库的 mb_strcut 函数存在信息泄露漏洞。当攻击者向该函数传递过大的第三个参数（length 参数）时，函数未能正确限制输出边界，导致可能泄露相邻内存中的敏感信息。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，获取服务器内存中的潜在敏感数据。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.3.0 至 5.3.3 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。官方已在 PHP 5.3.4 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4156"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-10T03:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:13Z","remediation":"将 PHP 升级至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mb_strcut() 函数中因第三个参数（length 参数）过大导致的内存信息泄露问题。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新：Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2011-0196 安全更新，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-1042-1 更新，Fedora 用户安装对应安全公告中的更新包。如无法立即升级，可在应用层面对传入 mb_strcut 函数的 length 参数进行严格校验，限制其最大值不超过字符串实际长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052836.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052845.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=130331363227777&w=2","http://pastie.org/1279428","http://pastie.org/1279682","http://secunia.com/advisories/42135","http://secunia.com/advisories/42812","http://secunia.com/advisories/43189","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:225","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2010/11/07/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/os