恶意构造的 PPT 文件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用的旧版 Office 组件，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。目前微软已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2572"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-11-10T03:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS10-088 (KB2293386) 提供的更新：PowerPoint 2002 SP3 安装 KB2413272，PowerPoint 2003 SP3 安装 KB2413304，PowerPoint Viewer 2007 SP2 安装 KB2413381。如无法打补丁，可通过 cacls/icacls 命令限制对 pp7x32.dll 的访问权限阻止解析 PowerPoint 95 文件，或启用 Microsoft Office File Block 策略禁止打开旧版二进制格式文件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-313A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2010/ms10-088","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12195","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2010-2572","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2010/CVE-2010-2572.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2572","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2572.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2010-2572.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2010-2572.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2010/CVE-2010-2572.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qrqx-wqch-hjh4/GHSA-qrqx-wqch-hjh4.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2010-2572.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0233","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0233.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3709","title":"PHP ZipArchive::getArchiveComment 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"PHP 的 ZipArchive::getArchiveComment 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞，当处理特制的 ZIP 压缩包时，该函数未能对传入参数进行有效验证，导致空指针被解引用从而引发程序崩溃。攻击者可通过向目标服务器提交恶意构造的 ZIP 文件触发此漏洞，造成 PHP 进程拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.2.x 至 5.2.14 及 5.3.x 至 5.3.3 版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。官方已在 PHP 5.3.4 及 5.2.15 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3709"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-09T01:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:23Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 5.3.4 或 5.2.15 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 PHP 5.3.4 的 ChangeLog 中标记为已修复。如无法立即升级，可在调用 ZipArchive::getArchiveComment() 方法前自行校验 ZIP 存档是否包含注释字段，避免传入恶意构造的 ZIP 文件触发空指针解引用导致服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052836.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-January/052845.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=130331363227777&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133469208622507&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/42729","http://secunia.com/advisories/42812","http://securityreason.com/achievement_securityalert/90","http://slackware.com/security/viewer.php?l=slackware-security&y=2010&m=slackware-security.490619","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://svn.php.net/viewvc/php/php-src/branches/PHP_5_2/ext/zip/php_zip.c?view=log","http://svn.php.net/viewvc/php/php-src/branches/PHP_5_3/ext/zip/php_zip.c?view=log","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15431","http://www.m