_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0202","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-3436","title":"PHP 5.3.x fopen_wrappers 安全绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.0至5.3.3版本中的fopen_wrappers.c文件存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制长度的文件名参数，绕过open_basedir配置限制访问受限文件。该漏洞源于对文件名长度校验不充分，导致攻击者能够读取本应被禁止访问的目录外的文件内容。影响所有使用受影响PHP版本构建的Web应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至PHP 5.3.4或更高版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-3436"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-11-09T01:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:22:46Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 fopen_wrappers.c 中文件名长度处理不当导致的 open_basedir 绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中严格配置 open_basedir 路径白名单，并禁用不必要的文件包装器（如 phar、zip）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011//Oct/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/42729","http://secunia.com/advisories/42812","http://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2010-3436","http://slackware.com/security/viewer.php?l=slackware-security&y=2010&m=slackware-security.490619","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5002","http://svn.php.net/viewvc/php/php-src/trunk/main/fopen_wrappers.c?r1=303824&r2=303823&pathrev=303824","http://svn.php.net/viewvc?view=revision&revision=303824","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:218","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","http://www.php.net/archive/2010.php#id2010-12-10-1","http://www.php.net/releases/5_2_15.php","http://www.php.net/releases/5_3_4.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/44723","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1042-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/3313","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0077","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2010/CVE-2010-34